]I was sent a petition to sign[ in] January[,] being run by Greenpeace but I don't remember seeing anything from 38 Degrees separately. Added just found this, I assume it's still[ relevant? speak]out.38deg[rees].org.uk/campaigns/fracking-keep-your-promise Just signed it[ and] it was accepted.[
